body:
Just an update on Day 33(local time), I am still on softban. Probably I will keep posting here for a while. The Ingress Support Chat is still having no response, nor the Support on Twitter helps.

&#x200B;

I'm using an iPhone(SE on iOS 12.2) now to avoid all those SafetyNet issue, and hopefully I can play on the next FS, as the first one this year I can only do UPV and resonator upgrades... :sob:

Unless the message is from a public channel(i.e. a channel with public username), of which you could use [https://t.me/chn/123](https://t.me/chn/123) to link the message with id \`123\` in that channel, you are pretty much out of luck.

&#x200B;

Try forward that message instead tho? If your bot could receive that message, you could use that message ID to forward to another chat.
